OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal as man dies after
OL,4,Afall from car
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for witnesses
OL,7,Fafter a man died following a fall from
OL,8,Fa car.
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police said it happened in
OL,11,FStation Car Park, Sunderland, just
OL,12,Fafter 06:00 BST on Sunday.
OL,14,FThe force said "for reasons to be
OL,15,Festablished" a 32-year-old man fell
OL,16,Ffrom a silver Ford Tourneo car.
OL,18,FThe man was taken to hospital with
OL,19,Flife-threatening injuries but died on
OL,20,FMonday. A 36-year-old woman arrested at
OL,21,Fthe scene was later released pending
OL,22,Ffurther inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
